stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Proposed
    Proposed --> Constrained: capability + ontology + authority constraints
    Constrained --> Pruned: dominated / invalid configuration
    Constrained --> Selected: informative experiment
    Selected --> Scheduled
    Scheduled --> Running
    Running --> EvidenceCaptured
    Running --> Blocked: typed external blocker
    EvidenceCaptured --> Evaluated
    Evaluated --> Learned: failure cluster / success signal
    Learned --> RepairProposed
    RepairProposed --> AdmittedRepair: falsifiers pass
    RepairProposed --> RejectedRepair: regression or weak evidence
    AdmittedRepair --> Regenerated
    Regenerated --> Selected: affected experiments re-enter
    Pruned --> [*]
    Blocked --> [*]
    RejectedRepair --> [*]
